<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson acquires control of Brazil JV.</title>
<headline>Ericsson acquires control of Brazil JV.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms group LM Ericsson AB on Tuesday said it was acquiring a voting majority in Ericsson Telecommunicacoes SA, its joint venture in Brazil.</p>
</text>
